    user -->|sends data| frontend
    frontend -->|auth request| bff
    bff -->|validates request| api_node
    api_node -->|generates hash| bcrypt
    api_node -->|issues token| jwt
    api_node -->|guarded by| middleware
    middleware -->|enforces| rate_limit
    rate_limit -->|session state| automatas
    bcrypt -->|audit event| sha256_chain
    sha256_chain -->|signs transaction| ecdsa
    ecdsa -->|encrypts record| aes_gcm
    aes_gcm -->|key custody| kms_hsm
    ecdsa -->|monitors session| digital_twin
    sha256_chain -->|proposed KDF (rejected)| navier
    api_node -->|queries| pgbouncer
    pgbouncer -->|pooled connection| postgres
    postgres -->|reads identity| users_table
    postgres -->|writes audit| audit_logs
    audit_logs -->|hash chained| audit_chain
    api_node -->|processing failure| dlq
    audit_chain -->|integrity alert| dlq
    api_node -->|collects metrics| prometheus
    prometheus -->|metrics| grafana
    grafana -->|renders| dashboards
    dlq -->|escalates| dlt
    dlt -->|notifies| slack
    dlt -->|reports| compliance
    audit_chain -->|legal evidence| legal
